  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The value of power dissipated across the zener diode <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> connected in the circuit as shown in the figure is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></math>.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0123_0e89318c9a7a.png\" style=\"width: 298px; height: 125px;\" /></p><p>The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;to the nearest integer is _______.</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0123_54fedc3f51df.png\" style=\"width: 298px; height: 125px;\" /></p><p>Voltage across <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p><p>Current through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">S</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>35</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p><p>Current through&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>15</mn><mn>90</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p><p>Current through zener <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>30</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p><p>Power through zener diode</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>V</mi><mi>I</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>30</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math> watt</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> watt</p>"
  }
